    {
      "id": "jf10-transform-core",
      "runtime": "jf10",
      "purpose": "Exhaustive current Jellyfin 10 File Transformation callback chain, including index and core-bundle consumers.",
      "installOrder": [
        "@refresh-kit",
        "file-transformation-jf10",
        "plugin-pages-jf10",
        "home-screen-sections-jf10",
        "collection-sections-jf10",
        "custom-tabs-jf10",
        "media-bar-jf10",
        "seerrfin-jf10",
        "intro-skipper-jf10",
        "letterboxd-sync-jf10",
        "notify-sync-jf10",
        "jellyfin-tweaks-jf10",
        "mdblist-ratings-jf10"
      ],
      "generationProbe": "letterboxd-sync-jf10",
      "stampingExpectation": "required",
      "cacheExpectation": "required",
      "requiredStampedArtifacts": [
        "letterboxd-sync-jf10",
        "notify-sync-jf10",
        "jellyfin-tweaks-jf10"
      ],
      "quarantinedAssertions": [
        "Seerr API behavior is not asserted because the lab intentionally has no external Seerr service.",
        "CDN/font delivery is represented by static hostile fixtures because the runtime network is internal-only.",
        "Intro Skipper core-bundle behavior is represented by real load/registration plus its existing hostile bundle fixture; this shell slice does not seed playback media.",
        "MDBList Ratings injects an inline block, so URL stamping is not applicable; load/coexistence remains required.",
        "WhisperSubs is isolated in jf10-transform-whisper because File Transformation 2.5.11 selects an exact index.html pipeline ahead of a separately registered regex pipeline; combining them would silently omit WhisperSubs rather than exercise its callback."
      ],
      "service": "jf10",
      "webrootExpectation": "read-only",
      "requiredPresentArtifacts": [],
      "requiredBodyMarkers": {},
      "configurationPatches": [],
      "contentProbes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jf10-transform-whisper",
      "runtime": "jf10",
      "purpose": "WhisperSubs regex File Transformation callback on the read-only Jellyfin Web root.",
      "installOrder": [
        "@refresh-kit",
        "file-transformation-jf10",
        "whisper-subs-jf10"
      ],
      "generationProbe": "whisper-subs-jf10",
      "stampingExpectation": "required",
      "cacheExpectation": "required",
      "requiredStampedArtifacts": [
        "whisper-subs-jf10"
      ],
      "quarantinedAssertions": [
        "File Transformation 2.5.11 selects an exact index.html registration before a matching regex registration, so this matrix deliberately excludes exact-key consumers and proves the real WhisperSubs regex callback in isolation. The writable direct-writer matrix separately proves WhisperSubs' on-disk fallback."
      ],
      "service": "jf10",
      "webrootExpectation": "read-only",
      "requiredPresentArtifacts": [],
      "requiredBodyMarkers": {},
      "configurationPatches": [],
      "contentProbes": []
    },
